Open CAD Studio

OpenCADStudio (OpenCADStudio.exe on Windows) is Open CAD Studio, the
open-source CAD application by Hakan Seven and the contributors of Open
CAD Studio: @URL@

It is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3; the text
is in @LICENCE_TEXT@. Open Pointcloud Studio carries it to
show exported drawings read-only.

It was built without changes from this commit of that repository:

    @COMMIT@ (@DATE@)

by native/packaging/build-open-cad-studio.sh of the source repository of
Open Pointcloud Studio, with the Rust crates that the Cargo.lock of that
commit lists, each one unmodified and under its own licence. Most of them
come from crates.io, which keeps the source of every version it has
published, under the name and version that Cargo.lock gives. These come
from git repositories instead, at the commits that Cargo.lock names:

    https://github.com/HakanSeven12/opencadcodec
    commit fe69506cb99dea6f4c4a73b690a27fdf04403ea0
        opencadcodec 0.5.5 (MPL-2.0)

    https://github.com/HakanSeven12/opencadgraph
    commit 892f942dff7b3082c195df82e560ac9ff44cec3b
        opencadgraph 0.1.0 (MPL-2.0)

    https://github.com/HakanSeven12/opencadkernel
    commit ae28f669f8a5673585c2c5c5b3617876c8b7bf98
        opencadkernel 0.1.0 (MPL-2.0)
        opencadkernel-constraints 0.1.0 (LGPL-2.1-or-later)

    https://github.com/HakanSeven12/iced_aw
    commit 9bff59df71c215abe91710870634886967fc9f1c
        iced_aw 0.14.1 (MIT)

    https://github.com/iced-rs/cryoglyph
    commit 53ba3e879539d19ed8162942126a977ec896cc3b
        cryoglyph 0.1.0 (MIT OR Apache-2.0 OR Zlib)

    https://github.com/iced-rs/iced
    commit 23604ff22ab0aad9e00b9327cb7b8546ed84db39
        iced 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_core 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_debug 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_futures 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_graphics 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_program 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_renderer 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_runtime 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_selector 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_test 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_tiny_skia 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_wgpu 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_widget 0.15.0-dev (MIT)
        iced_winit 0.15.0-dev (MIT)

    https://github.com/iced-rs/winit
    commit 05b8ff17a06562f0a10bb46e6eaacbe2a95cb5ed
        dpi 0.1.1 (Apache-2.0)
        winit 0.30.8 (Apache-2.0)

opencadcodec, opencadgraph and opencadkernel are covered by the Mozilla
Public License, version 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/), and
opencadkernel-constraints by the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1 or later
(https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.html). Each of the
four carries its licence text in its source.

The source is published on the release page of this version of Open
Pointcloud Studio,

    https://github.com/OpenAEC-Foundation/open-pointcloud-studio/releases/tag/v@VERSION@

as two files. @ARCHIVE@ holds every file of the commit
of Open CAD Studio, and @VENDOR_ARCHIVE@ holds the crates
from git repositories listed above, as Cargo vendors them, in the folder
vendor/ of that source. Unpacked in the same folder, the two build without
those repositories:

    cargo build --release --locked --bin OpenCADStudio --config vendor/config.toml

The commit of Open CAD Studio can also be fetched from its repository by
its hash.

Source code of Open Pointcloud Studio:
https://github.com/OpenAEC-Foundation/open-pointcloud-studio
